Here we have created a Weather forecast app , implementing OpenWeather API to recieve accurate information regarding the weather for the current as well as upcoming 4 days.

1) Users are able to select any location , via the city name and the system shall display the weather information for that city.
2) We have also implemented personal warnings if temperature is not suited for the outdoors.
3) All the users history is stores as well using localstorage allowing revisiting old searched.
4) Users can also search the information based on their Current Location 
5) The temperature can be displayed in various Units like Kelvin , Celcius and Fahrenheit.
